  "verseCount": 52,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu Jesu wauka achiphiya seemu ya Judea, ngʼambo ya Muho wa Joridani. Atu madiba-madiba amlunga tsona, naye achiafundza kama vyokala tabiyaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho, Mafarisayo anjina akpwendamuuza ili kumhega achili, achiamba, “Dze, shariya inamruhusu mutu kumricha mchewe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achiamba, “Kpwani Shariya za Musa zinaambadze?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.24.1+DEU.24.2+DEU.24.3+DEU.24.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 24:1–4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 5:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao achiamba, “Musa waruhusu mlume amuphe mchewe cheti cha talaka na amriche.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achiamba, “Musa wakuandikirani shariya iyo kpwa sababu ya mioyo yenu mifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.1.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 1:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.5.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "5:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hangu dunia iumbwe, ‘Mlungu waumba mlume na mchetu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 2:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Kpwa sababu hiyo, mlume andaricha ise na nine, agbwirane na mchewe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nao osi airi andakala mwiri mmwenga.’ Phahi atu hinyo si airi tsona ela ni mwiri mmwenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo ariounganishwa ni Mlungu, mwanadamu asiatenganishe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye, ariphokala ndani ya nyumba, anafundzie amuuza tsona dzulu ya dzambo hiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 5:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.7.10+1CO.7.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Akorintho 7:10–11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achiaambira, “Mutu arichaye mchewe akalóla mchetu wanjina, nkukala anazinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mchetu arichaye mlumewe na akalólwa ni mutu wanjina, nkukala anazinga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu amrehera Jesu anache adide ili aagute na kuajaliya, ela anafundzie achiademurira hara atu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphoona hivyo, wareya sana achiaambira, “Aricheni hinyo anache adide edze kpwangu, wala msiazuwiye, mana ufalume wa Mlungu ni wa anache dza hinya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.18.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 18:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuambirani kpweli, mutu asiyekuluphira ufalume wa Mlungu dza mwanache akuluphiravyo ise, kandauinjira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha waakusanya phakpwe chifuwani, achiabandikira mikono kpwa kuajaliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphokala anaandza kuuka, mutu mmwenga wamtsolokera mairo achimgbwerera maguluni, achimuuza, “Mwalimu mnono, nihendedze mino ili Mlungu aniphe uzima wa kare na kare?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achimuamba, “Kpwa utu wani unaniiha mnono? Takuna ariye mnono isiphokala Mlungu macheye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.12+EXO.20.13+EXO.20.14+EXO.20.15+EXO.20.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 20:12–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.16+DEU.5.17+DEU.5.18+DEU.5.19+DEU.5.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 5:16–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avi unamanya malagizo ga Mlungu: ‘Usiolage, usizini, usiiye, usizige myao na dzambo ra handzo, usichenge, tsona muishimu sowe na mayoo.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya tajiri achimuamba, “Mwalimu, higo gosi nágalunga hangu wanache wangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achimlola na achimmendza. Chisha achiamba, “Ukaphungukirwa ni chitu chimwenga tu. Phiya ukaguze chila chitu urichonacho, na pesaze ukaziganyire achiya, nawe undakala na akiba hiko mlunguni. Chisha ndzo unilunge.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya tajiri ariphosikira higo wasononeka, achiphiya vyakpwe na kureya, mana kala ana mali nyinji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu waalolato hara anafundzie osi, chisha achiaambira, “Indakala vigumu sana tajiri kuinjira kpwenye ufalume wa Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao anafundzie aangalazwa ni manenoge. Achiaambira tsona, “Anangu, indakala vigumu sana",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Vitabu vyanjina vya kare tavina seemu hino:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kpwa hara ambao anaona utajiri wao undaaokola.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kuinjira kpwenye ufalume wa Mlungu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni rahisi zaidi ngamia kutsapira na tundu ya sindano kuriko tajiri kuinjira kpwenye ufalume wa Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anafundzie achiangalala achiuzana, “Pho sambi ni ano ani ambao anaweza kuokolwa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Jesu waalolato na achiamba, “Dzambo hiri tariwezekana kpwa anadamu, ela kpwa Mlungu ni chitu chidide. Kpwa Mlungu chila chitu chinawezekana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero achimuuza, “Dze swino? Kpwani hwaricha vitu vyehu vyosi huchikulunga hukale anafundzio!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achiamba, “Nakuambirani kpweli, mutu yeyesi arichaye mudziwe ama ndugu alume na achetu, ise ama nine, anae, ama minda kpwa sababu yangu na kpwa sababu ya kutangazira atu habari zangu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:29",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chiyunani chinaamba,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kpwa ajili ya injili.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "andaphaha kano gana zaidi. Himu duniani andaphaha midzi, ndugu alume na achetu, mayo, ana na minda. Ela andateswa piya. Na wakati wedzao andaphaha uzima wa kare na kare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.20.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 20:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.13.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 13:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela anji ambao ni a kpwandza andakala a mwisho, na anji a mwisho andakala a kpwandza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, aenderera na charo chao cha kuphiya Jerusalemu, na Jesu wakala mbere anaalongoza. Hara anafundzi achitezeka na atu ariomlunga-lunga achitishirwa. Tsona Jesu wahala hara anafundzi kumi na airi achiphiya nao njama, na kuaambira gara ambago andahenderwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Phundzani, vivi hunaphiya Jerusalemu, ambako mimi, Mutu Yela Mlunguni, nindalaviwa kpwa akulu a alavyadzi-sadaka na alimu a Shariya, nao andaniamula kuolagbwa. Chisha andanilavya kpwa atu ambao sio Ayahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao andanizemerera, andanitehera mahe, andanichapa viboko na kuniolaga. Ela bada ya siku tahu nindafufuka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakobo na Johana anangbwa a Zebedayo, amlunga Jesu achendamuamba, “Mwalimu, hunalonda huuhendere chitu chochosi ndichokuvoya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achiauza, “Mnalonda nikuhendereni utu wani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao achimuamba, “Wakati uchitawala, hunakuvoya mmwenga asagale uphandeo wa kulume na wanjina uphandeo wa kumotso.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.50"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 12:50",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela achiaambira, “Tammanya mvoyaro. Dze, munaweza kuvumirira mateso ambago gandaniphaha? Hebu munaweza kugaya dza vivyo ndivyogaya mimi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao achimuamba, “Hunaweza.” Achiaambira, “Mateso ndigophaha, namwi mundagaphaha, na mundagaya dza vivyo ndivyogaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:39",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Maandiko ganjina ganaamba,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "“Dze, munaweza kunwerera chikombe ndichochinwerera au kubatizwa kama ndivyobatizwa?” Nao achijibu “Hunaweza.” Jesu achiaambira, “Chikombe ndichonererwa mundachinererwa kpweli, na mundabatizwa kama ndivyobatizwa.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela kusagala uphande wangu wa kulume au wa kumotso siyo kazi yangu kupanga. Dzambo hiro andahewa hara ambao aikirwa kare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara anafundzi kumi ariphosikira hivyo, aandza kureyera Jakobo na Johana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.22.25+LUK.22.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 22:25–26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Jesu waiha anafundzie na achiaambira, “Mnamanya kukala atawala a himu duniani nkutawala atu aho chinguvu-nguvu, na hinyo vilongozi nkuatawala atu aho na uwezo wao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 23:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.9.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mariko 9:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.22.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 22:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela kpwenu mwimwi taindakala hivyo. Amendzaye kukala mkpwulu ni lazima akale mtumishi wa ayae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na amendzaye kukala wa kpwandza kahi yenu, ni lazima akale mtumwa wa osi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana, ye Mutu Yela Mlunguni, kedzere kuhumikirwa, ela wakpwedzahumikira na alavye uzimawe ukale mzamana wa kukombola atu anji.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu na anafundzie atsupira mudzi wa Jeriko. Ariphokala anauka mudzi hinyo phamwenga na kundi kulu ra atu, chipofu, yeihwa Batimayo (manage ni mwana wa Timayo), kala asegere kanda-kanda ya barabara anavoya-voya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi hiye Batimayo, ariphosikira kukala Jesu wa Nazareti a pho phephi, waandza kukota kululu achiamba, “Jesu, Mwana wa Daudi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:47",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Manage ni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "chivyazi cha Mfalume Daudi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ", yani mutu yetsambulwa ni Mlungu kutawala atue.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nionera mbazi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu anji amdemurira anyamale, ela ye achizidi kukota kululu, “Jesu, Mwana wa Daudi, nionera mbazi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphosikira waima achiamba, “Muiheni.” Phahi, atu amuiha yuya chipofu, achimuamba, “Dziphe moyo! Unuka, anakuiha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye wabwaga nguwoye ya tadzi, achingʼoka, achiphiya kpwa Jesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achimuuza, “Unalonda nikuhendereni?” Yuya chipofu achimuamba, “Mwalimu, navoya nione.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achimuamba, “Kpwa sababu ya kunikuluphira ukaphola, kpwa hivyo phiya salama.” Phapho hipho yuya chipofu achikala anaona, na achimlunga-lunga Jesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
